Hello All,

Available for sale and shipment is:


=B7         Pt# 75-3028

=B7         Wrench for 2=94 Philmac 3G IPS-OD

=B7         List Price:  $52.00

Picture attached.  Color shipped is blue.

This product provides speedier installation of 2=94 Philmac 3G IPS-OD fitti=
ngs.  In particular it is useful for Acme fittings where so many joints hav=
e to be made.  With two wrenches an installer can tighten two nuts at once.=
  The customer should be urged to use these when Philmac Acme fittings are =
being used in particular.

Phil, being the lead on this item, might be consulted for detailed question=
s.  See Ed about pricing.

John

